                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game doesn't have any English language options (outside of a English keyboard option, which you have to control using the mouse, no physical keyboard support), so I had to use Google Translate to get through what I did end up playing. This doesn't really stand the test of time compared to today's Winning Post games, but that's expected from a game from 1993. If you like this, please buy it! Show KOEI that you want Winning Post 9 2022 or earlier in the west! This is probably my favorite horse game, so much so I would've bought Winning Post 9 2022 or something but this is the only Winning Post game available outside of Japan.\nThank you KOEI though for even deciding to release this stateside though. That gives me hope :)",
